{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1092", "sample_idx": 0, "model_name": "meta/llama-4-maverick-17b-128e-instruct", "content": "My recent trip to Japan was a sensory overload in the best possible way. From the moment I stepped off the plane, I was struck by the vibrant culture and stunning landscapes. Tokyo, with its neon-lit skyscrapers and bustling streets, was a whirlwind of activity. I spent hours exploring the city's many neighborhoods, from the trendy Harajuku to the historic Asakusa.\n\nOne of the highlights of my trip was visiting the famous Tsukiji Fish Market, where I sampled the freshest sushi of my life. I also took a day trip to the nearby city of Nikko, where I marveled at the ornate temples and shrines that dot the landscape.\n\nBut it was the natural beauty of Japan that truly left a lasting impression. A visit to the Japanese Alps revealed breathtaking scenery, with towering mountains and serene lakes. I also spent a peaceful evening soaking in a hot spring, surrounded by snow-capped peaks.\n\nThroughout my journey, I was struck by the warmth and hospitality of the Japanese people. Everywhere I went, I was greeted with a smile and a bow, and I felt welcomed and at ease. Japan is a country that seamlessly blends tradition and modernity, and I left with a deep appreciation for its unique culture and stunning landscapes. I'm already planning my next trip back.", "logprobs": [{"token": "My", "logprob": -0.5286079049110413}, {"token": " recent", "logprob": -0.002535939682275057}, {"token": " trip", "logprob": -6.794906312279636e-06}, {"token": " to", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " Japan", "logprob": -3.576278118089249e-07}, {"token": " was", "logprob": -6.437280717364047e-06}, {"token": " a", "logprob": -0.2549867331981659}, {"token": " sensory", "logprob": -1.5827924013137817}, {"token": " overload", "logprob": -0.04403623566031456}, {"token": " in", "logprob": -0.00016878610767889768}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -2.264974000354414e-06}, {"token": " be